# Populated from the Markdown repository by build.sh / deploy.yml.
/site/trees-md/
# Copies of the attachments the published trees embed, written by tree_of_md from
# the vault on every build. Owned by its manifest, not by git.
/site/assets/vault/
# Compiled from trees-md/ on every build, locally and in CI, so it is no longer
# committed: keeping it tracked would make every note edit produce a second,
# hand-committed diff.
/site/generated/
